anguage-math math-inline\">(4, 2, 1)</code></td>\n<td>etc.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/stochastic-mechanics/two-filtration-bridge-general-table-data.md","heading":"Table"}
